(92, 5, 2, 'The Opportunity', 'Priya used the private corridor while the music was loud...', NULL, '2026-09-12 18:12:00', '2026-09-12 18:12:00'),
(93, 5, 3, 'The Final Reveal', 'The broken phone contained a recording...', NULL, '2026-09-12 18:12:00', '2026-09-12 18:12:00'),
(163, 1, 1, 'The Will Change', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Three days before the party, Priya\r\naccidentally discovered a draft document in Raghav\'s study while looking for a\r\npen. The document was a revised will — after Raghav\'s death, the entire\r\nMalhotra estate would transfer to Vikram. Priya had been quietly counting on\r\nthis inheritance to settle a personal financial burden Vikram knew nothing\r\nabout. Losing even a portion of it was not something she could afford.<o:p></o:p></p>', 'full_story/yu5Wc7CAWOvniIrhP6lg18ZtPSidgqmNfycybfai.jpg', '2026-10-04 04:38:30', '2026-10-04 04:38:30'),
(164, 1, 2, 'Her Personal Secret', '<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Priya\r\nhad taken a personal loan of ₹10.8 crore from a private lender 8 months ago —\r\nwithout telling Vikram. She had invested it in a side business that had failed\r\ncompletely. She was counting on Vikram\'s inheritance to quietly repay this\r\nwithout Vikram ever finding out. The will change would make repayment\r\nimpossible and expose her secret altogether.</span>', 'full_story/LdAqYztxWNEBeb89YAcBJsdpkdufqc0HM3b3vBiY.png', '2026-10-04 04:38:30', '2026-10-04 04:38:30'),
(165, 1, 3, 'The Phone Call Was the Trigger', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">When Raghav called Vikram at 11:20 PM, Priya was standing\r\nnearby and overheard everything. Raghav was planning to donate 95% of the\r\nentire Malhotra estate to a farmer rehabilitation trust — leaving Vikram with\r\nalmost nothing. He was planning of announcing it publicly that very night in\r\nfront of media, lawyers and associates. Once announced it could never be\r\nreversed. Her repayment plan would collapse completely. Her secret would\r\nsurface. But if Raghav died tonight before making that announcement, the\r\nexisting will would stand unchanged. Vikram would inherit everything. Nobody\r\nwould ever know. She had minutes to decide. And she did.</span></p>', 'full_story/btBZAJRrU6c2PFpI4KSUC1vdhXFw6ZhM5bIwVfMd.jpg', '2026-10-04 04:38:30', '2026-10-04 04:38:30');

