(109, 6, 'The Investigator has 5 questions to examine any participant and establish the truth.', 1, '2026-06-05 15:36:31', '2026-06-05 15:36:31'),
(110, 6, 'First 5 minutes — all participants must review the Case Summary carefully. The Case Summary closes automatically after 5 minutes.', 2, '2026-06-05 15:36:31', '2026-06-05 15:36:31'),
(111, 6, 'Each participant has 2 minutes to respond when questioned. Failure to respond carries a penalty of -10 points.', 3, '2026-06-05 15:36:31', '2026-06-05 15:36:31'),
(112, 6, 'The Clue Room opens when 10 minutes remain in the session — one key piece of evidence becomes accessible.', 4, '2026-06-05 15:36:31', '2026-06-05 15:36:31'),
(113, 6, 'The Lie Detector round may be initiated once by the Investigator — up to 7 minutes, with max 3 questions.', 5, '2026-06-05 15:36:31', '2026-06-05 15:36:31'),
(114, 6, 'The Investigator must identify the accused before the session concludes. Total duration: 25 minutes.', 6, '2026-06-05 15:36:31', '2026-06-05 15:36:31'),
