(935, 4, 3, 'Your Weak Points', '#7f77dd', 'Why was the kettle boiled 30 minutes early? Also, Your personal connection to Kartar Sah.', '2026-10-04 04:38:30', '2026-10-04 04:38:30'),
(936, 4, 4, 'How To Handle The Investigation', '#7f77dd', 'You are not a suspect. Kartar connection — a shared district is not a crime. You have nothing to hide except one small habit.', '2026-10-04 04:38:30', '2026-10-04 04:38:30'),
(937, 5, 1, 'Your Situation', '#7f77dd', 'Your father called you at 11:20 PM. Last call. You walked toward the father room after. Staff saw you near east corridor at 11:26 PM. You turned back without entering.', '2026-10-04 04:38:30', '2026-10-04 04:38:30'),
